{"id":"635d9c2a8b21701e","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-constructible-hierarchy.md","title":"Constructible Hierarchy","display":"df-constructible-hierarchy — Constructible Hierarchy","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-constructible-hierarchy","aliases":["18-df-constructible-hierarchy","18-df-064"],"display":"df-constructible-hierarchy — Constructible Hierarchy","depends_on":["[[18-df-ordinal]]","[[18-df-kripke-platek-set-theory]]","[[18-df-satisfaction]]","[[18-df-assignment]]"],"source_work":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity (Springer, 2009)","source_section":"Definitions 11.3.1–11.3.2","source_printed_pages":"242","source_pdf_pages":"251","verification_status":"locally-revised-not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"source_proof_review":"未逐项复核原书证明","local_revision":"2026-10-14","local_review_scope":"definitions, syntax, explicit dependencies; not proof-assistant verification","prior_revision_verification_status":"source-statement-checked","prior_eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-constructible-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-constructible-hierarchy</span><span>18-df-064</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-constructible-hierarchy — Constructible Hierarchy"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cf95026e035bcb2b\" href=\"?note=cf95026e035bcb2b\" title=\"18-df-ordinal\">18-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e391b202f09e2f43\" href=\"?note=e391b202f09e2f43\" title=\"18-df-kripke-platek-set-theory\">18-df-kripke-platek-set-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"23419e8036fb68bd\" href=\"?note=23419e8036fb68bd\" title=\"18-df-satisfaction\">18-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"95cd5e4d0506772c\" href=\"?note=95cd5e4d0506772c\" title=\"18-df-assignment\">18-df-assignment</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_work","html":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity (Springer, 2009)"},{"key":"source_section","html":"Definitions 11.3.1–11.3.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"242"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"251"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_review","html":"未逐项复核原书证明"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"local_review_scope","html":"definitions, syntax, explicit dependencies; not proof-assistant verification"},{"key":"prior_revision_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"prior_eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>元理论为 ZFC；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"cf95026e035bcb2b\" href=\"?note=cf95026e035bcb2b\" title=\"18-df-ordinal\">18-df-ordinal</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_\\in\">\\(\\mathcal L_\\in\\)</span> 仅取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e391b202f09e2f43\" href=\"?note=e391b202f09e2f43\" title=\"18-df-kripke-platek-set-theory\">18-df-kripke-platek-set-theory</a> 中的纯集合论签名，不把该节点的理论公理加入构造。其变量集为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span>，关系符号为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\in_*\">\\(\\in_*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_\\in\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_\\in\\)</span> 为该签名公式集。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 为任意集合。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(M\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M_M\">\\(\\mathfrak M_M\\)</span> 是下式的集合结构，满足关系与赋值更新取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"23419e8036fb68bd\" href=\"?note=23419e8036fb68bd\" title=\"18-df-satisfaction\">18-df-satisfaction</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"95cd5e4d0506772c\" href=\"?note=95cd5e4d0506772c\" title=\"18-df-assignment\">18-df-assignment</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in M^W\">\\(\\beta\\in M^W\\)</span> 是全部变量上的赋值。每个公式仅有有限多个自由变量，因此该赋值表达有限参数，不引入无限参数公式。空集情形由单独分支给出，不调用不存在赋值的空结构满足关系。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> 是非零极限序数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 为下式的可定义类，不作为集合量化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nI_M&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\in_*,\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in M^2:a\\in b\\}\\rangle\\}\n\\quad(M\\ne\\varnothing),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M_M&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle M,I_M\\rangle\\quad(M\\ne\\varnothing),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Def}(\\varnothing)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\varnothing\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Def}(M)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\{a\\in M:\\mathfrak M_M\\models F[\\beta[a/w_0]]\\}:\nF\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\in,\\ \\beta\\in M^W\\}\\quad(M\\ne\\varnothing),\\\\\nL_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad L_{\\alpha+1}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Def}(L_\\alpha),\\\\\nL_\\lambda&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\alpha&lt;\\lambda}L_\\alpha,\\\\\nx\\in L&amp;\\longleftrightarrow\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;(x\\in L_\\alpha).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nI_M&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\in_*,\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in M^2:a\\in b\\}\\rangle\\}\n\\quad(M\\ne\\varnothing),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M_M&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle M,I_M\\rangle\\quad(M\\ne\\varnothing),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Def}(\\varnothing)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\varnothing\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Def}(M)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\{a\\in M:\\mathfrak M_M\\models F[\\beta[a/w_0]]\\}:\nF\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\in,\\ \\beta\\in M^W\\}\\quad(M\\ne\\varnothing),\\\\\nL_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad L_{\\alpha+1}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Def}(L_\\alpha),\\\\\nL_\\lambda&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\alpha&lt;\\lambda}L_\\alpha,\\\\\nx\\in L&amp;\\longleftrightarrow\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;(x\\in L_\\alpha).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留原可构造层级，修复 Def 所调用的满足关系与本册“结构载体非空”条件不一致的问题。空集仅有一个子集，所以单独定义 Def(∅)={∅}；非空情形使用现有、覆盖所有公式构造子的满足关系。对全部变量赋值与对公式有限自由变量提供参数得到相同的可定义子集族。每一层由集合分离、幂集和超限递归确定，不把真类 L 伪装成集合。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"cf95026e035bcb2b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-kripke-platek-set-theory","status":"resolved","id":"e391b202f09e2f43","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-kripke-platek-set-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"23419e8036fb68bd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"95cd5e4d0506772c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"cf95026e035bcb2b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"元理论为 ZFC；$\\mathrm{Ord}$ 见 [[18-df-ordinal]]。$\\mathc