name{Def}(\\varnothing)&\\coloneqq\\{\\varnothing\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Def}(M)&\\coloneqq\n\\{\\{a\\in M:\\mathfrak M_M\\models F[\\beta[a/w_0]]\\}:\nF\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\in,\\ \\beta\\in M^W\\}\\quad(M\\ne\\varnothing),\\\\\nL_0&\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad L_{\\alpha+1}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Def}(L_\\alpha),\\\\\nL_\\lambda&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\alpha<\\lambda}L_\\alpha,\\\\\nx\\in L&\\longleftrightarrow\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;(x\\in L_\\alpha).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2926,"backlinks":[{"id":"d93cc27ebf4fb0d3","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A$ 为集合，$\\mathrm{Trans}(A)$、$\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)$ 及序数类 $\\mathrm{Ord}$ 见 [[./18-df-transitive-set]]、[[./18-df-ordinal]]。$L_\\alpha$ 为 [[./18-df-constructible-hierarchy]] 的构造层级，仅在序数 $\\alpha$ 上使用。"},{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-126","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-constructible-hierarchy]]"},{"id":"100d7af02276fe1b","anchor":"ref-66","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-constructible-hierarchy]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-26","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-constructible-hierarchy]]"},{"id":"bf01645e59119446","anchor":"ref-23","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-constructible-hierarchy|18-df-constructible-hierarchy]]"},{"id":"09f8f6fb03023072","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-constructible-hierarchy|18-df-constructible-hierarchy]]"}],"outgoing":["cf95026e035bcb2b","e391b202f09e2f43","23419e8036fb68bd","95cd5e4d0506772c"]}